  "route": "/personal-ai-assistant.html",
  "title": "Personal AI assistant and plans | RoboRingo",
  "description": "Your personal AI assistant can take the conversation when you can\u2019t. Get the context, review the summary, and decide what happens next.",
  "html": "<main id=\"main-content\" class=\"section pa-detail\">\n <section class=\"pa-detail-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"pa-title\"><div><a class=\"pa-back\" href=\"/#personal-assistant\">Back to RoboRingo</a><h1 id=\"pa-title\">A little less ringing.<br><span class=\"pa-hero-emphasis\">A lot more living.</span></h1><p>Your personal AI assistant can take the conversation when you can\u2019t. Get the context, review the summary, and decide what happens next.</p><div class=\"pa-actions\"><a class=\"primary\" href=\"#plans\">Find your plan</a><a href=\"/contact\" data-enquiry-subject=\"Personal AI assistant\">Talk to us</a></div><div class=\"pa-hero-journey\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Talk, review, decide, and get things done with your personal assistant\">\n <svg class=\"pa-journey-path\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 280\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <defs><linearGradient id=\"pa-journey-colour\"><stop stop-color=\"#bdeba4\"/><stop offset=\".55\" stop-color=\"#6cc777\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#cce884\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n  <path class=\"pa-journey-halo\" d=\"M60 115H540\" stroke=\"#b7e89a\" stroke-width=\"18\" opacity=\".16\"/>\n  <path class=\"pa-journey-base\" d=\"M60 115H540\" stroke=\"url(#pa-journey-colour)\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <path class=\"pa-journey-current\" d=\"M60 115H540\" pathLength=\"100\" stroke=\"#f1ffd5\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"9 91\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n </svg><div class=\"pa-journey-stop pa-journey-stop-0\"><span class=\"pa-journey-icon\"><svg width=\"31\" height=\"31\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h14v12H10l-5 4V4Z\"/><path d=\"M8 9h.1m4 0h.1m4 0h.1\"/></svg></span><span class=\"pa-journey-label\">Talk</span></div><div class=\"pa-journey-stop pa-journey-stop-1\"><span class=\"pa-journey-icon\"><svg width=\"31\" height=\"31\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 7h8M8 11h8M8 15h5\"/></svg></span><span class=\"pa-journey-label\">Review</span></div><div class=\"pa-journey-stop pa-journey-stop-2\"><span class=\"pa-journey-icon\"><svg width=\"31\" height=\"31\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\" fill=\"var(--journey-node)\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\" fill=\"var(--journey-node)\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\" fill=\"var(--journey-node)\"/></svg></span><span class=\"pa-journey-label\">Decide</span></div><div class=\"pa-journey-stop pa-journey-stop-3\"><span class=\"pa-journey-icon\"><svg width=\"31\" height=\"31\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4.5 4.5L19 7\"/></svg></span><span class=\"pa-journey-label\">Get things done</span></div>\n\n</div></div><div class=\"pa-demo\"><div class=\"pa-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Explore the personal assistant\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"pa-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"pa-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">Screen a call</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"pa-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"pa-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Read the summary</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"pa-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"pa-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Choose the next step</button></div><div class=\"pa-phone\" aria-label=\"Personal assistant example screens\"><div class=\"pa-phone-screen\"><div class=\"pa-device-status\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>9:41</span><i></i><span>\u25cf</span></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pa-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"pa-tab-0\" tabindex=\"0\">\n    <div class=\"pa-phone-top\"><img src=\"/assets/logos/roboringo.svg\" alt=\"RoboRingo\" width=\"1556\" height=\"319\"><span>Personal AI assistant</span></div>\n    <div class=\"pa-call-orb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/icons/platform-mcp.svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"></div><p class=\"pa-screen-label\">Incoming call</p><h3>Calling about an appointment</h3>\n    <div class=\"pa-screen-note\"><strong>Assistant is listening</strong><p>I\u2019ll take the details and pass them on.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"pa-audio\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"--bar:10px;--delay:0.0s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:21px;--delay:0.09s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:15px;--delay:0.18s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:32px;--delay:0.27s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:24px;--delay:0.36s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:40px;--delay:0.44999999999999996s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:28px;--delay:0.54s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:18px;--delay:0.63s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:33px;--delay:0.72s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:21px;--delay:0.8099999999999999s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:12px;--delay:0.8999999999999999s\"></i></div>\n  </div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pa-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"pa-tab-1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pa-phone-top\"><img src=\"/assets/logos/roboringo.svg\" alt=\"RoboRingo\" width=\"1556\" height=\"319\"><span>Personal AI assistant</span></div>\n    <div class=\"pa-call-orb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/icons/platform-audio.svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"></div><p class=\"pa-screen-label\">Call summary</p><h3>Appointment request</h3>\n    <div class=\"pa-screen-note\"><strong>Details captured</strong><p>The caller would like to move their appointment to Friday.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"pa-audio\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"--bar:10px;--delay:0.0s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:21px;--delay:0.09s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:15px;--delay:0.18s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:32px;--delay:0.27s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:24px;--delay:0.36s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:40px;--delay:0.44999999999999996s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:28px;--delay:0.54s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:18px;--delay:0.63s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:33px;--delay:0.72s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:21px;--delay:0.8099999999999999s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:12px;--delay:0.8999999999999999s\"></i></div>\n  </div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pa-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"pa-tab-2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"pa-phone-top\"><img src=\"/assets/logos/roboringo.svg\" alt=\"RoboRingo\" width=\"1556\" height=\"319\"><span>Personal AI assistant</span></div>\n    <div class=\"pa-call-orb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/icons/platform-crm.svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"></div><p class=\"pa-screen-label\">Next step</p><h3>Ready when you are</h3>\n    <div class=\"pa-screen-note\"><strong>Follow-up suggested</strong><p>Review the appointment request and return the call when you are free.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"pa-audio\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"--bar:10px;--delay:0.0s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:21px;--delay:0.09s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:15px;--delay:0.18s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:32px;--delay:0.27s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:24px;--delay:0.36s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:40px;--delay:0.44999999999999996s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:28px;--delay:0.54s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:18px;--delay:0.63s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:33px;--delay:0.72s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:21px;--delay:0.8099999999999999s\"></i><i style=\"--bar:12px;--delay:0.8999999999999999s\"></i></div>\n  </div><div class=\"pa-phone-home\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div></div><span class=\"pa-example\">Example conversation</span></div></section>\n <section class=\"pa-block pa-feature-band\" aria-labelledby=\"pa-features\"><h2 id=\"pa-features\">Made for the calls<br>that interrupt your day.</h2><div class=\"pa-feature-grid\"><article><img src=\"/assets/icons/platform-mcp.svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"><h3>A call comes in. You stay focused.</h3><p>RoboRingo asks who is calling and what they need, using the instructions you set.</p></article><article><img src=\"/assets/icons/platform-audio.svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"><h3>The important bits. In one place.</h3><p>Catch up with a concise call summary and the details you need for your next conversation.</p></article><article><img src=\"/assets/icons/platform-crm.svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"><h3>Pick up where the call left off.</h3><p>Use the captured context to decide who to call back and what needs your attention.</p></article></div></section>\n <section class=\"pa-collage-section pa-block\" id=\"your-day\" aria-labelledby=\"pa-collage-title\">\n<div class=\"pa-collage-wrap\"><div class=\"pa-collage\" data-lenis-prevent-horizontal aria-label=\"Explore three personal assistant features\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pa-flip pa-collage-main\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Calls, taken care of. Your assistant captures who called and why, while you stay with what matters. Flip card for details.\">\n <span class=\"pa-flip-inner\">\n  <span class=\"pa-flip-front\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/images/assistant-focus.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pa-flip-affordance\"><svg class=\"pa-inline-icon\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9a8 8 0 0 1 14-3l2 3M20 15a8 8 0 0 1-14 3l-2-3M4 4v5h5m11 11v-5h-5\"/></svg><span>Explore</span></span></span>\n  <span class=\"pa-flip-back\"><img class=\"pa-flip-watermark\" src=\"/assets/images/assistant-line-calls.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"><img class=\"pa-flip-icon\" src=\"/assets/icons/platform-mcp.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\"><strong>Calls, taken care of.</strong><span class=\"pa-flip-description\">Your assistant captures who called and why, while you stay with what matters.</span></span>\n </span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pa-flip pa-collage-review\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"The details, remembered. Come back to a clear call summary, with the information you need. Flip card for details.\">\n <span class=\"pa-flip-inner\">\n  <span class=\"pa-flip-front\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/images/assistant-summary.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pa-flip-affordance\"><svg class=\"pa-inline-icon\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9a8 8 0 0 1 14-3l2 3M20 15a8 8 0 0 1-14 3l-2-3M4 4v5h5m11 11v-5h-5\"/></svg><span>Explore</span></span></span>\n  <span class=\"pa-flip-back\"><img class=\"pa-flip-watermark\" src=\"/assets/images/assistant-line-summary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"><img class=\"pa-flip-icon\" src=\"/assets/icons/platform-audio.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\"><strong>The details, remembered.</strong><span class=\"pa-flip-description\">Come back to a clear call summary, with the information you need.</span></span>\n </span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pa-flip pa-collage-follow\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Your next step, clearer. Keep the context ready and pick up the conversation in your own time. Flip card for details.\">\n <span class=\"pa-flip-inner\">\n  <span class=\"pa-flip-front\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/images/assistant-follow-up.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pa-flip-affordance\"><svg class=\"pa-inline-icon\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9a8 8 0 0 1 14-3l2 3M20 15a8 8 0 0 1-14 3l-2-3M4 4v5h5m11 11v-5h-5\"/></svg><span>Explore</span></span></span>\n  <span class=\"pa-flip-back\"><img class=\"pa-flip-watermark\" src=\"/assets/images/assistant-line-follow-up.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"><img class=\"pa-flip-icon\" src=\"/assets/icons/platform-crm.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\"><strong>Your next step, clearer.</strong><span class=\"pa-flip-description\">Keep the context ready and pick up the conversation in your own time.</span></span>\n </span></button></div><p class=\"pa-collage-hint\"><span class=\"pa-hint-desktop\">Hover or tap an image to explore.</span><span class=\"pa-hint-mobile\">Swipe to browse. Tap an image to flip.</span></p></div>\n <div class=\"pa-collage-copy\"><h2 id=\"pa-collage-title\">Your day keeps moving.<br>Your assistant keeps up.</h2><p>Stay with what you\u2019re doing. Your assistant takes the call, captures the details, and keeps the context ready for you.</p>\n  <div class=\"pa-key-details\">\n   <article><img src=\"/assets/icons/platform-mcp.svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"><div><h3>Calls, taken care of.</h3><p>Capture who called and why, even when you\u2019re in a meeting.</p></div></article>\n   <article><img src=\"/assets/icons/platform-audio.svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"><div><h3>The details, remembered.</h3><p>Come back to a clear summary, with the information that matters.</p></div></article>\n   <article><img src=\"/assets/icons/platform-crm.svg\" width=\"48\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"><div><h3>Your next step, clearer.</h3><p>Keep the context close and follow up when you\u2019re ready.</p></div></article>\n  </div><a class=\"primary\" href=\"/contact\" data-enquiry-subject=\"Personal AI assistant setup\">Discuss your setup</a>\n </div></section>\n <section class=\"pa-block\" id=\"plans\" aria-labelledby=\"pa-plans-title\"><div class=\"pa-plans-heading\"><h2 id=\"pa-plans-title\">More space in your day.<br>A plan that fits.</h2><p>Choose the monthly minutes that work for you.</p></div><div class=\"pa-plans\">\n <article class=\"pa-plan pa-plan-illustrated\"><div class=\"pa-plan-body\"><div class=\"pa-plan-heading\"><h3>Personal</h3><img class=\"pa-plan-symbol\" src=\"/assets/icons/assistant-plan-personal.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"56\"></div><p class=\"pa-price\"><strong>\u20b9999</strong><span>/ month</span></p><p class=\"pa-plan-included\"><svg class=\"pa-inline-icon\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg><span><b>120 minutes</b> included each month</span></p><p class=\"pa-extra pa-plan-extra\"><svg class=\"pa-inline-icon\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h14v16H5zM8 8h8M8 12h4M15 13v5m-2-2.5h4\"/></svg><span>Extra minutes at \u20b96 / minute</span></p><a class=\"primary\" href=\"/contact\" data-enquiry-subject=\"Personal AI assistant - Personal plan\"><svg class=\"pa-inline-icon\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4h16v12H9l-5 4V4zM8 8h8M8 12h5\"/></svg><span>Ask about Personal</span></a></div></article>\n <article class=\"pa-plan pa-plan-illustrated\"><div class=\"pa-plan-body\"><div class=\"pa-plan-heading\"><h3>Personal Plus</h3><img class=\"pa-plan-symbol\" src=\"/assets/icons/assistant-plan-plus.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"56\"></div><p class=\"pa-price\"><strong>\u20b91,999</strong><span>/ month</span></p><p class=\"pa-plan-included\"><svg class=\"pa-inline-icon\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg><span><b>300 minutes</b> included each month</span></p><p class=\"pa-extra pa-plan-extra\"><svg class=\"pa-inline-icon\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h14v16H5zM8 8h8M8 12h4M15 13v5m-2-2.5h4\"/></svg><span>Extra minutes at \u20b95 / minute</span></p><a class=\"primary\" href=\"/contact\" data-enquiry-subject=\"Personal AI assistant - Personal Plus plan\"><svg class=\"pa-inline-icon\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4h16v12H9l-5 4V4zM8 8h8M8 12h5\"/></svg><span>Ask about Personal Plus</span></a></div></article></div></section>\n <section class=\"pa-block pa-questions\" aria-labelledby=\"pa-faq-title\"><h2 id=\"pa-faq-title\">A few things to know.</h2>\n <details><summary>What happens after I use my included minutes?</summary><p>Extra minutes cost \u20b96 per minute on Personal and \u20b95 per minute on Personal Plus.</p></details>\n <details><summary>Can I use this with my current number?</summary><p>Tell us which number and carrier you use. We\u2019ll walk you through the available setup and call-handling options.</p></details>\n <details><summary>Which languages can my assistant use?</summary><p>Share the languages you need with our team so we can confirm the right voice and setup for your calls.</p></details>\n <details><summary>How do I get started?</summary><p>Choose a plan to open an email enquiry. Our team will help with your instructions, number setup, and activation.</p></details></section>\n</main>",
